{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：对AD对象进行WRITEDAC访问。对应需求：防御规避。官方：WRITEDAC Access on Active Directory Object。","from":"now-119m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.*"],"interval":"60m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：对AD对象进行WRITEDAC访问","references":["https://www.blackhat.com/docs/us-17/wednesday/us-17-Robbins-An-ACE-Up-The-Sleeve-Designing-Active-Directory-DACL-Backdoors.pdf"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"f5861570-e39a-4b8a-9259-abd39f84cb97","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"host.os.type: \"windows\" and event.action : (\"Directory Service Access\" or \"object-operation-performed\") and\n  event.code : \"4662\" and winlog.event_data.AccessMask:\"0x40000\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1222","name":"File and Directory Permissions Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1222/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1222.001","name":"Windows File and Directory Permissions Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1222/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：对AD对象进行WRITEDAC访问\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权